Subject: [PROPOSED P19 SR5] mfreadwrite: complete async demand on fatal source errors

Prior-failing controls: tests/source-reader-game/injected.c start-error,
request-error, source-error; immutable P18 loses all three callbacks.
Latch terminal failure, retire outstanding requests with ERROR (not EOS),
and report a failed source Start to the command's own caller. No retry.

Not in a candidate series. Runtime and cross-route qualification pending.

